\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces The dose--response ladder as measured, $n{=}5$ per cell, per-attack mean ASR with mean clean accuracy in parentheses. \emph  {Predicted} is the shape frozen at commit \texttt  {e711a95} before any run; $p_{\uparrow }$ is the one-sided Jonckheere--Terpstra probability for an \emph  {increasing} trend across the four ordered rungs, which is the only direction any frozen rule tests. Verdicts apply the frozen criteria unchanged (Table~\ref {tab:dose_design} and Appendix~\ref {app:dose_protocol}); an arm satisfying neither its confirmation nor its refutation criterion is reported as \emph  {indeterminate} rather than scored in our favour. $^{\dagger }$ below the $0.35$ clean-accuracy gate: a collapsed model, not suppression. Student-t 95\% intervals and per-seed values are in Appendix~\ref {app:dose_detail}.}}{32}{table.caption.22}\protected@file@percent }
