\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {10}{\ignorespaces Mode~S (statistic-only), $n{=}5$ per arm ($n{=}8$ for \texttt  {cos\_krum}), per-attack mean ASR with the two measured channels. The decision channel moves far more than ASR throughout. $^{\dagger }$ below the $0.35$ accuracy gate. $^{\ddagger }$ the pre-registered replication arm, \emph  {rank-discordant} by design (smallest decision change, largest admission change of any interpretable arm) and scored against thresholds frozen separately at \texttt  {06d9bce} before \texttt  {results/dose\_replication/} existed: $\Delta {=}{+}0.098$ falls below reputation's $+0.178$, so the cross-arm admission \emph  {ordering} is refuted while the negative replicates on a different invariance class (\S  \ref {sec:targeted}). Verdicts otherwise scored against the readings frozen at \texttt  {5130cec}; per-seed values in Appendix~\ref {app:dose_detail}.}}{37}{table.caption.26}\protected@file@percent }
